Subject: [PATCH 48/83] =?UTF-8?q?contrib:=20gtk2=20(GTK+=202.24.33)=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20completes=20the=20GTK+=202.x=20stack?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The GTK+ 2 toolkit, cross-built via substrate_sysroot against the full
stack (glib2/gdk-pixbuf/pango/atk/cairo + fontconfig/freetype/libpng/
pixman + X).  Produces libgtk-x11-2.0, libgdk-x11-2.0, libgailutil +
gtk+-2.0.pc, all OSABI-stamped.

gcc16: -std=gnu11 and a -Wno-error set (GTK 2.24 predates the C23 bool
keyword and the incompatible-pointer-types-as-error change).  SRC_SUBDIRS
trimmed to gdk/gtk/modules (demos/tests/perf run the cross gdk-pixbuf-
csource at build time, which can't execute on the host).

This is the last of the GTK+ 2.x port chain: libpng, freetype, expat,
libXrender, fontconfig, cairo, libffi, glib2, harfbuzz, fribidi, atk,
pango, gdk-pixbuf, gtk2 — all built shared against the substrate stack.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 contrib/gtk2/README.SUBSTRATE.md | 18 ++++++++++++
 contrib/gtk2/build.sh            | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 contrib/gtk2/fetch.sh            | 19 ++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 87 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 contrib/gtk2/README.SUBSTRATE.md
 create mode 100755 contrib/gtk2/build.sh
